wow this december marks the first full  financial year for recruitment mentors  which is crazy so in this short video i  wanted to share some of the amazing  milestones and highlights from this year  whilst also saying a massive thank you  to everyone who's been part of our  journey today 2021 has been all about  turning an idea into building traction  and this is what traction looks like  in numbers  since we opened our community doors in  november 2020 we have welcomed  354 recruiters who have all joined us to  progress their careers we've partnered  with 35 recruitment companies since june  to support them in developing their  teams after launching our team  membership to our eight founding  agencies in april we've onboarded 95  mentors who have all either delivered  bite-sized sessions or live interactive  training sessions for all of our  recruiters to attend what this  accumulates to is 50 hours worth of l d  content and so far this year we posted  37 live training sessions and we now  have a number of recruiters who have  been with us and who we've supported for  over a year this is honestly  amazing none of this would have been  possible without the fantastic mentors  who have all been nothing short of  brilliant sharing their best tips and  advice on everything from winning  business managing counter offers and  building the ultimate day plan  everything we have done this year has  come from aiming to take a step closer  to our vision which at recruitment  mentors is to build the place that  enables recruitment professionals to  maximize their potential at every stage  of their recruitment career and this  year 2021 we have most certainly taken a  step closer to realizing our vision so a  massive thank you to every single  recruitment company every single  recruitment consultant that has  partnered with us this year given us a  chance and believed in what we're trying  to achieve  with recruitment mentors we have massive  plans next year to continue to level up  our learning platform to help even more  recruitment consultants progress their  careers without limits and we're even  looking to make our first hire shortly  it's very exciting i'm going into the  end of the year feeling positive  optimistic so really keep tuned a huge  thanks again to everyone that supported  us and you're going to see a lot more  from us in 2022
 

